<title>USA: Texaco seeks partner for U.S. nat gas unit.</title>
<headline>Texaco seeks partner for U.S. nat gas unit.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texaco Inc is looking for a partner for its U.S. natural gas operations, Chief Executive Officer Peter Bijur said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He told security analysts the company is &quot;seeking more (natural) gas for our system,&quot; noting the company was very pleased with its gas business.</p>
<p>&quot;We do not want to monetize (it)...We want to grow our gas business,&quot; Bijur said, answering securities analysts' questions. &quot;We're looking on a continual basis for a partner.&quot;</p>
</text>
